=== square-root / double-√ impact literacy (NOT edge) ===
cite: arXiv:2502.16246 — double square-root: child √q + time decay → metaorder √Q; scramble → mechanical
cite: arXiv:2411.13965 — TSE complete survey: δ≈1/2 universal within errors
cite: Gatheral 2010 Quant. Finance 10(7) DOI 10.1080/14697680903373692 — no-dynamic-arbitrage: exp decay ↔ only linear impact
formula: I ≈ Y · σ · √(Q/V)  — cost RULER, not alpha; reject optimize-Y→alpha
tension: Almgren–Chriss linear temporary η vs empirical √; AC remains a desk utility frontier
